# Design system

Full reference: `docs/design-system.md`. Use **only standard Tailwind classes** — no arbitrary values (`text-[…]`, `shadow-[…]`, etc.).

## Quick tokens

- **Font:** Open Sans (`font-sans`)
- **Headings:** `text-cyan-950 font-bold`
- **Body:** `text-slate-700`, secondary `text-slate-500`
- **Accent:** `text-cyan-600` / `bg-cyan-50`
- **Primary CTA:** `btn-primary` or `bg-slate-700 text-white rounded-lg font-semibold shadow-md`
- **Ghost CTA:** `btn-ghost` or `border border-slate-300 text-cyan-950 rounded-lg`
- **Cards:** `card` (`shadow-sm`) or `card-elevated` (`shadow-lg border-cyan-100`)
- **Layout:** `page-shell` (`max-w-7xl px-5 md:px-16`), sections `py-16`
- **Eyebrow:** `eyebrow` (`text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-cyan-600`)
- **Page header:** `PageHeader` component with optional `actions` slot
- **Tables:** `data-table`, `data-table-head`, `data-table-row`, `data-table-td`
- **Empty states:** `EmptyState` component — never empty table rows
- **Badges:** `RoleBadge` / `StatusBadge` for roles and status
- **Filters:** `FilterTabs` component (`filter-tab`, `filter-tab-active`)
- **Breadcrumbs:** `Breadcrumbs` on form and detail pages
- **Sidebar active:** `admin-sidebar-link-active` with `border-l-2 border-cyan-600`

## Rules

1. Light-first UI — white backgrounds, `bg-gradient-to-b from-white via-blue-50 to-white` between sections
2. `cyan-950` + `cyan-600` for brand; `slate-*` for neutrals
3. App buttons use `rounded-lg` (not `rounded-full`)
4. Aurora blobs: `rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-20` with `bg-purple-300` / `bg-cyan-200`
5. Header: `h-16 sticky top-0 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-xl border-b border-cyan-200`
6. Dashboards: `PageHeader` without `card-elevated` wrapper; stat cards below
7. Login pages: `LoginPageShell` with cross-portal footer link
